{% extends 'base.html.j2' %}
{% from 'components.html.j2' import eyebrow, sources, cta with context %}
{% block content %}
<section class="tool-intro wrap">{{ eyebrow('THE THAILAND VISA FINDER') }}<h1>Let’s find your<br><em>starting point.</em></h1><p>A few questions about your plans. A shortlist of routes to explore.<br>No account. No contact details needed.</p></section>
<section class="wrap tool-workspace"><div id="visa-finder" class="quiz-card"><div class="quiz-top"><span>{{ icon('compass') }} YOUR ROUTE TO EXPLORE</span><span id="quiz-step">01 / 04</span></div><div class="quiz-progress" aria-hidden="true"><span id="quiz-progress"></span></div><div id="quiz-content" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="quiz-actions"><button type="button" id="quiz-back" class="text-link">← Back</button><button type="button" id="quiz-next" class="button" disabled>Next question {{ icon('arrow') }}</button></div></div><aside class="tool-explainer"><h2>A clearer first<br>conversation.</h2><p>Your result is a starting shortlist, rather than an eligibility decision. We’ll highlight the evidence and circumstances that need checking.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>{{ icon('check') }} Results stay in your browser</li><li>{{ icon('check') }} No sensitive documents</li><li>{{ icon('check') }} Official sources for the next check</li></ul><p class="small">The responsible authority makes visa and immigration decisions. Rules and accepted documents depend on your route and place of application.</p><a class="text-link" href="{{ url('visas/') }}">Compare all visa routes {{ icon('arrow') }}</a></aside></section><noscript><div class="wrap notice">The interactive finder needs JavaScript. You can <a href="{{ url('visas/') }}">compare all visa routes here</a> or contact the team for a route review.</div></noscript>
{% endblock %}

